{"sha": "8bcff0e2832ffec271ebb3bc644a56e2d00e10a98d4954a7a3032ab54dc59fd0", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[RC 充电的能量平衡]\\label{prop:b1:transient-regimes:rcenergy}", "将电容器从 $0$ 充至 $E$（经任意电阻 $R$）时，", "电源提供 $CE^2$，电容器储存 $\\tfrac12 CE^2$，", "而电阻耗散另外的 $\\tfrac12 CE^2$ --- 无论 $R$ 取何值。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$i = (E/R)\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$；电源提供的能量为 $\\int_0^\\infty Ei\\,\\dd t", "= E \\cdot (E/R)\\tau = CE^2$；电阻吸收的能量为 $\\int_0^\\infty Ri^2\\,\\dd t", "= (E^2/R)\\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-2t/\\tau}\\dd t = (E^2/R)(\\tau/2) = \\tfrac12 CE^2$；", "两者之差即为所储存的 $\\tfrac12 CE^2$。较小的 $R$ 会更快地", "耗散同样的能量。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[继电器线圈]\\label{ex:b1:transient-regimes:relay}", "$L = \\qty{20}{mH}$，$R = \\qty{5.0}{\\ohm}$，$E = \\qty{10}{V}$：$\\tau =", "\\qty{4.0}{ms}$，$i_\\infty = \\qty{2.0}{A}$；触点在", "$i$ 达到 \\qty{1.5}{A} 时吸合，即于 $t = -\\tau\\ln(1 - 0.75) =", "\\qty{5.5}{ms}$ 时刻。断开电路时，$i$ 须自 \\qty{2}{A} 开始下降；", "在线圈两端并联一只“续流”二极管，使电流仅经 $R$", "形成通路，$\\tau = \\qty{4}{ms}$，而非产生电火花。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{二阶系统}", "", "\\begin{definition}[二阶系统的标准形式]\\label{def:b1:transient-regimes:secondorder}", "\\index{二阶线性系统}\\index{固有角频率}\\index{品质因数}\\index{阻尼比}", "若物理量 $x(t)$ 满足下式，则称其为\\emph{二阶线性系统}：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\dd^2 x}{\\dd t^2} + \\frac{\\omega_0}{Q}\\,\\frac{\\dd x}{\\dd t} + \\omega_0^2\\,x", "= \\omega_0^2\\,x_\\infty ,", "\\]", "其中 $\\omega_0 > 0$ 为\\emph{固有角频率}，$Q > 0$ 为", "\\emph{品质因数}（无量纲），$x_\\infty$ 为稳态。", "亦可记为 $\\omega_0/Q = 2\\xi\\omega_0$，其中 $\\xi = 1/2Q$ 为", "\\emph{阻尼比}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[串联 RLC 电路]\\label{prop:b1:transient-regimes:rlc}", "\\index{RLC 电路}", "电容器 $C$、线圈 $L$ 与电阻 $R$ 串联，并接于", "电源 $E$ 两端时，电容器电压服从标准形式，其参数为", "\\[", "\\omega_0 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{LC}}, \\qquad Q = \\frac{1}{R}\\sqrt{\\frac{L}{C}},", "\\qquad u_{C,\\infty} = E .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由回路定律 $E = L\\,\\dd i/\\dd t + Ri + u_C$，代入 $i = C\\,\\dd u_C/\\dd t$：", "$LC\\,u_C'' + RC\\,u_C' + u_C = E$；两边除以 $LC$，可得", "$\\omega_0^2 = 1/LC$，$\\omega_0/Q = R/L$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,0) to[battery1, l=$E$, invert] (0,2.6) to[R=$R$] (2.4,2.6) to[L=$L$, i=$i$] (4.8,2.6) -- (4.8,2.6) to[C=$C$, v=$u_C$] (4.8,0) -- (0,0);", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.6cm]", "    \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (0,3.4);", "    \\fill[pattern=north east lines] (-0.25,0) rectangle (0,3.4);", "    % spring", "    \\draw[thick] (0,2.6) -- (0.4,2.6) \\foreach \\i in {0,...,5} {-- ++(0.2,0.25) -- ++(0.2,-0.5) -- ++(0.2,0.25)} -- (3.3,2.6);", "    % damper", "    \\draw[thick] (0,0.8) -- (1.2,0.8);", "    \\draw[thick] (1.2,0.5) -- (1.2,1.1) -- (2.2,1.1); \\draw[thick] (1.2,0.5) -- (2.2,0.5);", "    \\draw[thick] (1.9,0.6) -- (1.9,1.0); \\draw[thick] (1.9,0.8) -- (3.3,0.8);", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!15] (3.3,0.2) rectangle (4.5,3.2); \\node at (3.9,1.7) {$m$};", "    \\draw[-Stealth] (3.9,3.5) -- (5.2,3.5) node[right] {$x$};", "    \\node at (1.7,3.15) {$k$}; \\node at (1.7,0.1) {$\\alpha$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 二阶系统的两种实例：串联 RLC", "电路（$\\omega_0 = 1/\\sqrt{LC}$，$Q = \\sqrt{L/C}/R$）与", "质量--弹簧--阻尼器（$\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{k/m}$，$Q = \\sqrt{km}/\\alpha$）。", "方程相同，三种情形亦相同。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[机械振子]\\label{prop:b1:transient-regimes:mechanical}", "\\index{质量--弹簧--阻尼器}\\index{机电类比}", "质量为 $m$ 的物体系于劲度系数为 $k$ 的弹簧上，并连有黏滞阻尼器，", "阻尼系数为 $\\alpha$（阻尼力为 $-\\alpha\\dot x$），物体偏离平衡位置的位移为 $x$，", "满足 $m\\ddot x + \\alpha\\dot x + kx = 0$，属于标准形式，", "参数为：", "\\[", "\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}, \\qquad Q = \\frac{\\sqrt{km}}{\\alpha} .", "\\]", "对应关系为 $x \\leftrightarrow q$，$\\dot x \\leftrightarrow i$，", "$m \\leftrightarrow L$，$\\alpha \\leftrightarrow R$，$k \\leftrightarrow 1/C$", "使一个系统的每一结论都映射到另一个系统上。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由牛顿第二定律（见\\cref{ch:b1:newton-dynamics}），", "代入弹簧力 $-kx$ 与阻尼力，两边除以 $m$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[三种情形]\\label{thm:b1:transient-regimes:regimes}", "\\index{非周期情形}\\index{临界情形}\\index{准周期情形}\\index{准周期}", "齐次方程 $x'' + (\\omega_0/Q)x' +", "\\omega_0^2 x = 0$ 的解由 $r^2 + (\\omega_0/Q)r +", "\\omega_0^2 = 0$ 的根决定，其判别式为 $\\Delta = \\omega_0^2(1/Q^2 - 4)$：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 当 $Q < \\tfrac12$ 时，\\emph{非周期情形}：两个负实根", "        $r_\\pm = -\\frac{\\omega_0}{2Q}\\big(1 \\mp \\sqrt{1 - 4Q^2}\\big)$，", "        $x = A\\eu^{r_+t} + B\\eu^{r_-t}$，无振荡地回归；", "  \\item 当 $Q = \\tfrac12$ 时，\\emph{临界情形}：二重根 $r = -\\omega_0$，", "        $x = (A + Bt)\\eu^{-\\omega_0 t}$，回归最快，", "        且无超调；", "  \\item 当 $Q > \\tfrac12$ 时，\\emph{准周期情形}：复根", "        $r = -1/\\tau \\pm \\iu\\omega$，其中", "        \\[", "        \\tau = \\frac{2Q}{\\omega_0}, \\qquad", "        \\omega = \\omega_0\\sqrt{1 - \\frac{1}{4Q^2}},", "        \\qquad", "        x = \\eu^{-t/\\tau}\\big(A\\cos\\omega t + B\\sin\\omega t\\big),", "        \\]", "        即阻尼振荡，其\\emph{准周期}为 $T = 2\\pi/\\omega$，", "        振荡位于包络 $\\pm\\sqrt{A^2 + B^2}\\,\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$ 之内。", "\\end{itemize}", "右端为常数时，完整解为 $x_\\infty$ 与", "齐次方程的解之和；$A$、$B$ 由 $x(0)$ 和 $x'(0)$ 确定。", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}